---
/* Rich body for the "Designing a support chat experience" case
   study (Namecheap). A 3-minute, decision-led read: context, three
   decisions, the result, and a short hindsight section. Optional detail
   sits behind CaseDetail expanders. The shared [slug].astro template
   renders this when the slug matches and passes the summary through
   the slot. Shared .rwc-* layout/typography lives in global.css and
   the image lightbox in CaseBodyLightbox.astro. */
import CaseBodyLightbox from './CaseBodyLightbox.astro';
import CaseDetail from './CaseDetail.astro';
import CaseReadBar from './CaseReadBar.astro';
---

<div class="rwc-body">

  {/* HERO */}
  <section class="rwc-hero" id="case-context">
    <div class="rwc-hero-left">
      <div class="case-cat" data-pt={'Caso de estudo · Plataforma de suporte ao cliente da Namecheap'}>Case study · Platform for Namecheap's customer support</div>
      <h1 class="case-title" data-pt={'Desenhar uma experiência de chat de suporte'}>Designing a support chat experience</h1>
      <p class="case-subtitle" data-pt={'Um chat de suporte e uma app para agentes feitos de raiz para a Namecheap, com um design system próprio. 97,4% de feedback positivo quatro meses após o lançamento.'}>
        An in-house support chat and agent app for Namecheap, designed from
        scratch with its own design system. 97.4% positive feedback four months
        after launch.
      </p>
      <dl class="rwc-aside rwc-facts">
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Função'}>Role</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'UX Designer'}>UX Designer</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Responsabilidades'}>Responsibilities</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'Lead designer, revisor de código front-end'}>Lead designer, front-end code reviewer</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Equipa'}>Team</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'Um product manager, um engineering manager e a equipa de engenharia'}>A product manager, an engineering manager and the engineering team</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Duração'}>Duration</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'10 meses'}>10 months</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="rwc-hero-right">
      <img class="rwc-hero-mark" src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/hero-mark.svg" alt="Namecheap mark" data-pt-alt="Logótipo da Namecheap" loading="eager" />
      <div class="case-img-ph rwc-hero-img is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/hero.webp" alt="Namecheap branding — Building a better online world together" data-pt-alt="Marca da Namecheap — Building a better online world together" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
      <p class="case-img-caption" data-pt={'Imagem da Namecheap, via namecheap.com'}>Image by Namecheap via namecheap.com</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Summary, passed in from [slug].astro */}
  <slot />

  <CaseReadBar minutes={4} />

  {/* CONTEXT */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-challenge">
    <div class="rwc-challenge">
      <div class="rwc-challenge-text">
        <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Contexto'}>Context</div>
        <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Cinco chats ao mesmo tempo, em mais de 20 separadores do browser'}>Five chats at once, across 20+ browser tabs</h2>
        <p data-pt={'As equipas de suporte da Namecheap trabalhavam no Kayako, uma ferramenta datada que não se ajustava à forma como trabalhavam. Os agentes geriam mais de cinco chats ao mesmo tempo, com mais de 20 separadores do browser abertos, cada um com uma ferramenta diferente, e precisavam de muita formação para as aprender todas. Os clientes tinham dificuldade em chegar rapidamente ao chat sem os dados da conta, e poucos deixavam feedback no fim, o que resultava em maus valores de NPS. O pedido era uma app de suporte interna: um chat com um bot para os clientes e uma app para agentes.'}>
          Namecheap's support teams worked in Kayako, a dated tool that didn't
          fit how they worked. Agents handled more than five chats at once with
          20+ browser tabs open, each a different tool, and needed heavy training
          to learn them all. Customers struggled to reach chat quickly without
          their account info, and few left feedback at the end, which led to poor
          NPS scores. The brief was an in-house support app: a chat with a bot
          for customers, and an agent application.
        </p>

        <p class="rwc-currently-live" data-pt={'<strong>Atualmente online em:</strong><br/><a href="https://www.namecheap.com/help-center/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Help Center da Namecheap</a><br/><a href="https://www.spaceship.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spaceship</a>'}>
          <strong>Currently live at:</strong><br/>
          <a href="https://www.namecheap.com/help-center/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Namecheap's Help Center</a><br/>
          <a href="https://www.spaceship.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spaceship</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-challenge-img">
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/chat-widget-feedback.webp" alt="Chat widget with Your Feedback Matters thumbs prompt" data-pt-alt="Widget de chat com o pedido de feedback “Your Feedback Matters” e os polegares" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 1 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-kickoff">
    <div class="rwc-challenge">
      <div class="rwc-challenge-text">
        <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 1'}>Decision 1</div>
        <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Começar pelos agentes'}>Start with the agents</h2>
        <p data-pt={'Antes de desenhar fosse o que fosse, fui à sede do suporte ao cliente da Namecheap, na Ucrânia, conhecer agentes, supervisores e gestores e ver como trabalham todos os dias. Tudo o que ouvi foi para um experience canvas que serviu de planta do projeto, ao lado de um benchmark de ferramentas concorrentes.'}>
          Before designing anything, I went to Namecheap's customer support HQ in
          Ukraine to meet agents, supervisors and managers and see how they work
          every day. Everything I heard went into an experience canvas that served
          as the blueprint for the project, next to a benchmark of competing tools.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-challenge-img">
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="1-1">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/shadowing.webp" alt="Shadowing a Namecheap customer support agent at their desk in Ukraine" data-pt-alt="A acompanhar um agente de suporte da Namecheap na sua secretária, na Ucrânia" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <CaseDetail label="The canvas and the benchmark" labelPt="O canvas e o benchmark">
      <div class="case-img-ph-grid cols-2">
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="1-1">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/experience-canvas.webp" alt="Experience canvas template — hypothesis, problems, value, users, MVP, success metrics" data-pt-alt="Modelo de experience canvas — hipótese, problemas, valor, utilizadores, MVP, métricas de sucesso" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="1-1">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/competitive-benchmark.webp" alt="Competitive support tool — VIP inbox, conversations, and reply panel" data-pt-alt="Ferramenta de suporte concorrente — caixa de entrada VIP, conversas e painel de resposta" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </CaseDetail>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 2 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-customer-chat">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 2'}>Decision 2</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Um widget, não uma janela'}>A widget, not a window</h2>
    <p data-pt={'O Kayako abria uma janela separada do sistema operativo. Nós fizemos do chat um widget flutuante que acompanha o cliente enquanto navega.'}>
      Kayako opened a separate OS window. We made the chat a floating widget that
      stays with the customer while they browse.
    </p>

    <div class="rwc-annotated">
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled rwc-annotated-img" data-ratio="3-4">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/chat-widget.webp" alt="Annotated customer-facing chat widget" data-pt-alt="Widget de chat para o cliente, anotado" loading="lazy" />
      </div>

      <ul class="rwc-annotated-list">
        <li data-pt={'O cabeçalho mostra o estado do sistema: se há um agente disponível e se há erros.'}>The header shows system status: whether an agent is available, and any errors.</li>
        <li data-pt={'As mensagens enviadas e recebidas ficam em lados opostos, para que o autor seja claro sem depender da cor.'}>Sent and received messages sit on opposite sides, so the author is clear without relying on colour.</li>
        <li data-pt={'As mensagens enviadas com menos de 10 segundos de intervalo ficam agrupadas.'}>Messages sent within 10 seconds of each other stack together.</li>
        <li data-pt={'O campo de texto só mostra controlos extra quando está em foco ou quando há ficheiros prontos a enviar.'}>The input reveals extra controls only when focused or when files are ready to send.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <CaseDetail label="How the design got there" labelPt="Como o design lá chegou">
      <div class="rwc-sketch-grid">
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
          <img class="rwc-flip-v" src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/sketch-ui-notes.webp" alt="Sketchbook: UI notes into messages — chat bubble layouts" data-pt-alt="Caderno de esboços: notas de UI para mensagens — layouts de balões de chat" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled rwc-rotated-tile" data-ratio="1-1">
          <img class="rwc-rotate-90" src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/sketch-arrangement.webp" alt="Sketchbook: arrangement notes and admin report wireframes" data-pt-alt="Caderno de esboços: notas de disposição e wireframes de relatórios de administração" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/sketch-bubble-variants.webp" alt="Sketchbook: chat bubble variants — T, T+A, T+A+Expand" data-pt-alt="Caderno de esboços: variantes do balão de chat — T, T+A, T+A+Expand" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-columns cols-2">
        <p data-pt={'Definir a disposição dos balões de chat e distinguir as mensagens recebidas das enviadas só com o layout. Pensar também nas ações específicas de cada mensagem.'}>
          Working out the arrangement between chat bubbles, and
          distinguishing received from sent ones, just by using layout. Also
          considering each message's specific actions.
        </p>
        <p data-pt={'Wireframes para mapear as variantes do balão de chat. T - Só texto / T+A - Texto e anexo / T+A+Expand - Tudo isto, mas com uma mensagem de texto enorme (permitindo recolher/expandir).'}>
          Wireframes to map out the variants of the chat bubble. T - Just
          text / T+A - Text and attachment / T+A+Expand - All the previous
          but containing a huge text message (allowing collapse/expand).
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* System blueprints / User flows */}
      <div class="rwc-subsection">
        <h3 class="rwc-h3" data-pt={'System blueprints / fluxos de utilizador'}>System blueprints / User flows</h3>
        <p data-pt={'Este system blueprint + fluxo para tratar alertas de desconexão, erros de autenticação e erros gerais foi uma grande parte de garantir que o sistema dava a UX certa em momentos tão críticos.'}>
          This system blueprint + flow to tackle alerts on
          disconnect/auth-error/general errors was a big part of making sure
          the system provided the right UX at such critical moments.
        </p>
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole is-whole-capped" data-ratio="16-9">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/system-blueprint.webp" width="1024" height="1006" alt="System blueprint and user flow tackling disconnect, auth-error, and general-error alerts" data-pt-alt="System blueprint e fluxo de utilizador para alertas de desconexão, erro de autenticação e erros gerais" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* High-fi prototypes */}
      <div class="rwc-subsection">
        <h3 class="rwc-h3" data-pt={'Protótipos high-fi'}>High-fi prototypes</h3>
        <p data-pt={'Passámos para a alta fidelidade e para o motion design, onde quisemos dar ao chat um aspeto descontraído, com um tom de voz neutro.'}>
          Moved on to high-fidelity and motion design, where we aimed to
          provide an easy-going appearance to the chat, with a neutral
          tone-of-voice.
        </p>

        <div class="rwc-columns cols-3 rwc-columns-hifi">
          <div class="rwc-column">
            <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
              <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/floating-button-states.webp" alt="Floating button — hover, default, agent avatar variants for Storybook Clients and Agents" data-pt-alt="Botão flutuante — variantes hover, predefinida e com avatar do agente, para o Storybook de Clientes e Agentes" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <p class="rwc-caption" data-pt={'Esquema dos estados do botão flutuante (em cima) e vista completa do widget aberto, com uma conversa a decorrer.'}>
              Scheme of the floating button states (above), and a complete
              view of the widget opened with an ongoing conversation.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="rwc-column">
            <div class="rwc-error-stack">
              <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="1-1">
                <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/error-503.webp" alt="503 error illustration — ladder, wrench, and pile in a hole" data-pt-alt="Ilustração do erro 503 — escada, chave inglesa e um monte num buraco" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="1-1">
                <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/error-404.webp" alt="404 error illustration — ladder and magnifying glass over a hole" data-pt-alt="Ilustração do erro 404 — escada e lupa sobre um buraco" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="rwc-caption" data-pt={'Ilustrações para os erros.'}>Illustrations for errors.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rwc-column">
            <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
              <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/chat-widget.webp" alt="High-fidelity chat widget mockup — Jane Doe Available" data-pt-alt="Mockup de alta fidelidade do widget de chat — Jane Doe disponível" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="rwc-bullets">
        <li data-pt={'Os avatares aparecem só nas mensagens dos agentes, porque os clientes não têm foto de perfil.'}>Avatars appear only on agents' messages, as customers don't have a profile picture.</li>
        <li data-pt={'O botão flutuante é animado para transmitir o aspeto e a sensação que queríamos.'}>The floating button is animated to carry the look and feel we wanted.</li>
      </ul>
    </CaseDetail>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 3 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-design-system">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 3'}>Decision 3</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'White-label desde o primeiro dia'}>White-label from day one</h2>
    <p data-pt={'O chat era para ser um produto white-label, por isso o design system começou com dois temas, para namecheap.com e ssls.com, assentes em tokens de estado e em paletas por marca. Mantive a documentação no Sketch, sincronizada com os repositórios de front-end do Storybook.'}>
      The chat was meant to be a white-label product, so the design system started
      with two themes, for namecheap.com and ssls.com, built on status tokens and
      per-brand palettes. I kept the documentation in Sketch and in sync with the
      Storybook front-end repositories.
    </p>

    {/* Very tall source (678x1600): show the top at real size, the lightbox has the rest. */}
    <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="16-10" style="max-width:678px;margin-inline:auto">
      <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/button-docs.webp" alt="Button component documentation — variants, sizes, color classes, states" data-pt-alt="Documentação do componente botão — variantes, tamanhos, classes de cor, estados" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <CaseDetail label="Tokens, components and accessibility" labelPt="Tokens, componentes e acessibilidade">
      <div class="rwc-columns cols-2">
        <div class="rwc-column">
          <h3 data-pt={'Tokens de estado'}>Status tokens</h3>
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/status-colors.webp" alt="Status colors — Success, Warning, Danger, Info tokens at 10/40/50 stops" data-pt-alt="Cores de estado — tokens Success, Warning, Danger e Info nos níveis 10/40/50" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rwc-column">
          <h3 data-pt={'Paleta por marca'}>Per-brand palette</h3>
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/ssls-colors.webp" alt="SSLs.com primary color palette — sep-ssl tokens" data-pt-alt="Paleta de cores primárias do SSLs.com — tokens sep-ssl" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-columns cols-2">
        <div class="rwc-column">
          <h3 data-pt={'Variantes de componentes'}>Component variants</h3>
          <p data-pt={'Mapeámos e criámos componentes para alimentar o sistema à medida que as necessidades e funcionalidades do produto evoluíam. (Componente de alerta acima.)'}>
            We mapped and created components to feed the system as the
            product needs and features evolved. (Alert component above.)
          </p>
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/alert-component.webp" alt="Alert component variants — default, danger, warning, success, info" data-pt-alt="Variantes do componente de alerta — default, danger, warning, success, info" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rwc-column">
          <h3 data-pt={'Anatomia dos componentes'}>Component anatomy</h3>
          <p data-pt={'Cada componente tinha uma descrição da sua anatomia e composição.'}>
            Each component had a description of its anatomy and composition.
          </p>
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/floating-button-anatomy.webp" alt="Floating button anatomy — background, optional badge, content slots" data-pt-alt="Anatomia do botão flutuante — fundo, badge opcional, slots de conteúdo" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-subsection">
        <h3 class="rwc-h3" data-pt={'Acessibilidade web'}>Web accessibility</h3>
        <p data-pt={'Para cumprir as diretrizes WCAG, aplicámos conformidade de contraste (A, AA), detalhes de ordem de foco e estados de foco para navegação por teclado e por voz.'}>
          To match WCAG guidelines, we applied contrast compliance (A, AA),
          focus ordering details, and focus states for keyboard and speech
          navigation.
        </p>
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole is-whole-capped" data-ratio="16-9">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/accessibility.webp" width="1024" height="985" alt="Web accessibility examples — feedback form, focus order, focus outline on keyboard press" data-pt-alt="Exemplos de acessibilidade web — formulário de feedback, ordem de foco, contorno de foco ao usar o teclado" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </CaseDetail>
  </section>

  {/* RESULT */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-impact">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Resultado'}>Result</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'97,4% de feedback positivo, e mais chats'}>97.4% positive feedback, and more chats</h2>

    <div class="rwc-stats">
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">28.9<span class="rwc-stat-unit">%</span></div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Aumento nos chats de atendimento ao cliente no mesmo período. De 15 mil com o Kayako para 21 mil, em 4 meses.'}>
          Increase in customer engagement chats for the same period. From
          15k using Kayako, to 21k, in 4 months.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">4800<span class="rwc-stat-unit">+</span></div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Chats com feedback — um aumento de mais de 15% face ao mesmo período antes do lançamento.'}>
          Chats received feedback — an increase of over 15% compared to
          the same period before launch.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">97.4<span class="rwc-stat-unit">%</span></div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Feedback positivo em todos os chats, sobre o novo chat e a nova experiência de suporte.'}>
          Positive feedback to all chats, on the new chat and support
          experience.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p data-pt={'O chat está online em <a href="https://www.namecheap.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">namecheap.com</a> e <a href="https://www.spaceship.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">spaceship.com</a>, com um tema para cada marca.'}>
      The chat is live on
      <a href="https://www.namecheap.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">namecheap.com</a>
      and
      <a href="https://www.spaceship.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">spaceship.com</a>,
      themed for each brand.
    </p>

    <div class="rwc-columns cols-2">
      <div class="rwc-column">
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/floating-motion.gif" alt="Floating button and chat window motion in the live product" data-pt-alt="Movimento do botão flutuante e da janela de chat no produto online" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <p class="rwc-caption" data-pt={'Movimento do botão flutuante e da janela de chat.'}>Floating button and chat window motion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rwc-column">
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="3-4">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/live-chat.gif" alt="Live product — chat widget menu with Namecheap Engagement.AI agent" data-pt-alt="Produto online — menu do widget de chat com o agente Namecheap Engagement.AI" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <p class="rwc-caption" data-pt={'Menu do widget de chat.'}>Chat widget menu.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* HINDSIGHT */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-retrospective">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Em retrospetiva'}>Hindsight</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Nem tudo funcionou à primeira'}>Not everything worked first time</h2>
    <p data-pt={'Depois do lançamento, vimos que a navegação do lado dos agentes era ineficiente, o que confirmámos ao falar com os agentes. Ajustámo-la, testámo-la e, em duas semanas, tínhamos uma versão de que gostaram: 4,6 em 5 de satisfação, e preferida à primeira versão.'}>
      After launch we found that navigation on the agent side was inefficient,
      which we confirmed by following up with agents. We adjusted it, tested it,
      and within two weeks had a version they were happy with: 4.6 out of 5 for
      satisfaction, and preferred over the first release.
    </p>

    <div class="case-img-ph-grid cols-2">
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="16-10">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/preference-survey.webp" alt="Preference survey results between the new and previous navigation" data-pt-alt="Resultados do inquérito de preferência entre a nova navegação e a anterior" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="16-10">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/namecheap/satisfaction-chart.webp" alt="Satisfaction emoji chart — 0%, 0%, 15%, 44%, 41%" data-pt-alt="Gráfico de satisfação com emojis — 0%, 0%, 15%, 44%, 41%" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>

